"The Whisper" is the operational alias of an information broker operating out of [[Sharn]]'s [[Callestan]] district in [[Lower Dura]]. True identity unknown; suspected to be a changeling.

The Whisper deals exclusively in secrets — political, military, and arcane. Their network of informants reportedly spans all Five Nations. They do not sell information cheaply, and they never sell the same secret twice to competing interests.

The Whisper appears to have foreknowledge of events related to the [[Vault of Whispers]], a rumored pre-Galifaran repository of bound extraplanar entities, and may be seeking the Vault for reasons of their own.

!! Operational Notes
* Communications made via enchanted sending stones left at dead drops
* Never meets clients directly; uses glamoured intermediaries
* Known to operate from a safehouse near the [[Fallen]] (exact location unknown)

!! Known Clients
* [[Lady Elaydren d'Cannith]] (confirmed)
* [[The Boromar Clan]] (suspected)
* Unknown party in [[Aundair]] (rumored)

!! Connections
* [[Sharn]] (base of operations)
* [[House Phiarlan]] (unknown relationship)
* [[The Vault of Whispers]] (direct interest)
